# The Lander's build context is the repo root. Admit only what its image
# copies: the sdk and the packages it imports, for `bundleRules`. Nothing else
# of the repo, no env file and no node_modules, reaches the build. Docker reads
# this file only for a build that names the Dockerfile by its path; wrangler
# pipes the Dockerfile on stdin, so the Dockerfile's COPY lines name each
# path they take as well.
**
!packages/brand/package.json
!packages/brand/src/**
!packages/protocol/package.json
!packages/protocol/src/**
!packages/sdk/package.json
!packages/sdk/src/**
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
